<section class="section" id="subsidy-tax-analysis">
  <h2>4. Impact of Subsidies and Taxation on Retail Prices</h2>
  <p class="objective">Evaluate how subsidy levels influence the retail price consumers pay, segmented by income level. Assess whether high-subsidy countries show lower price pass-through from crude oil fluctuations.</p>

  <div class="compare-grid">
